Package: edgeai-gst-plugins
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libc6,
 libstdc++6,
 edgeai-tiovx-modules,
 edgeai-apps-utils,
 edgeai-dl-inferer,
 ti-tidl-osrt,
 libgstreamer1.0-0,
 libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0
Description: TI EdgeAI GStreamer plugins
 Custom GStreamer elements that offload compute to hardware accelerators
 and DSPs on TI K3 devices.  Provides GStreamer 1.0 plugins for TI EdgeAI
 pipelines.
 .
 Plugins are installed to /usr/lib/gstreamer-1.0/ for automatic discovery
 by gstreamer.  Also installs source at /opt/edgeai-gst-plugins/.
